{% comment %}
Gallery of PESO (Paid/Earned/Shared/Owned) deliverables, pulled straight
from every campaign-hub campaign's own `pillars` list (see
_layouts/campaign-hub.liquid) — currently Open Mind and Rare Hair. A
campaign-single campaign (Sun Bum, CAVA x Bumble, YSC) has no `pillars` and
is simply skipped, so this grows on its own the next time a campaign gets
the full PESO treatment; nothing here needs to be hardcoded per campaign.

Used by the standalone "Media Specializations" page (_layouts/media-gallery,
pages/media-specializations.md) — that page's own call-out banner supplies
the <h1>, so this starts straight at the intro paragraph.
{% endcomment %}
<section class="peso-gallery" data-peso-gallery>
    <div class="peso-gallery__inner">
        <p class="peso-gallery__intro">
            Every integrated campaign runs through four channels — Paid, Earned, Shared, and
            Owned media. Filter below to see how each one plays out in practice.
        </p>

        <div class="peso-gallery__pills" role="group" aria-label="Filter by media type">
            <button type="button" class="peso-gallery__pill is-active" data-peso-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">All</button>
            <button type="button" class="peso-gallery__pill" data-peso-filter="paid" aria-pressed="false">Paid</button>
            <button type="button" class="peso-gallery__pill" data-peso-filter="earned" aria-pressed="false">Earned</button>
            <button type="button" class="peso-gallery__pill" data-peso-filter="shared" aria-pressed="false">Shared</button>
            <button type="button" class="peso-gallery__pill" data-peso-filter="owned" aria-pressed="false">Owned</button>
        </div>

        <div class="pillar-grid peso-gallery__grid">
            {% for campaign in site.portfolio %}
            {% for pillar in campaign.pillars %}
            <a class="pillar-card" data-media="{{ pillar.key }}"
               href="{{ pillar.url | relative_url }}"
               {% if campaign.accent %}style="--campaign-accent: {{ campaign.accent }};"{% endif %}>
                <span class="pillar-card__eyebrow">{{ pillar.label }}</span>
                <p class="pillar-card__campaign">{{ campaign.title }}</p>
                <h3 class="pillar-card__title">{{ pillar.title }}</h3>
                <p class="pillar-card__desc">{{ pillar.teaser }}</p>
                {% if pillar.items %}
                <ul class="pillar-card__items">
                    {% for item in pillar.items %}<li>{{ item }}</li>{% endfor %}
                </ul>
                {% endif %}
                <span class="pillar-card__cta">{{ pillar.cta | default: 'View this section' }} &rarr;</span>
            </a>
            {% endfor %}
            {% endfor %}
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
